nt": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn9le15ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "renowned"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "known by many people; famous"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This has been demonstrated by renowned musicians such as Luciano Pavarotti and David Bowie."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le15ob03aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about jobs."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "non-governmental organization"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an organization that is not for profit and not part of a government"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They came together in the 90s to perform several concerts for War Child, a non-governmental organization (NGO)."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le15ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "music therapist"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a therapist who uses music to promote healing"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Music therapists work alongside pediatricians and other health professionals to ease pain and encourage recovery in patients."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le15ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "career path"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " the way you progress in your work, within a job or a series of jobs"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This exciting new career path is being chosen by increasing numbers of music lovers."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le15ob03aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "physician"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a medical doctor"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: More patients are being referred to music therapists by physicians."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le15ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "psychologist"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "someone who \u200bstudies the \u200bhuman \u200bmind"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The psychologist asked her a series of detailed questions."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le15ob03aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "occupational therapist"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " someone who promotes recovery by encouraging the activities used in daily life"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He was referred to an occupational therapist because of his back problems."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le15ob03aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pediatrician"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a doctor who specializes in treating children"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: After the checkup, the pediatrician gave the child a lollipop."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le15ob03aud08"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Come up with a list of ten different jobs."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Beside each one, write a sentence explaining how music could be implemented in that profession."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Present your list to a partner, and discuss the pros and cons of each."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I brainstorm ten different types of jobs."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I explain how music can be used in each job."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share my ideas with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I discuss the pros and cons of each suggestion."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Passive: The Present Continuous and Present Perfect Tenses"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Present Continuous to talk about an action that is happening at the time of speaking. The action or event is in progress.  </br><span class=\"italic\">Universities <span class=\"strong\">are adding</span> music therapy programs to their course lists.</span></br></br>You use the Present Perfect to talk about a finished action or event with present consequences. There is a connection between what happened in the past and the present. </br><span class=\"italic\">People <span class=\"strong\">have said</span> that music has a healing effect.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You often choose the passive form when you want to talk about an action but are not so interested in saying who or what does/did it. Passives without <span class=\"italic\">agents</span> (the doers) are common in academic and scientific writing. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at the chart below for the structure of the passive voice."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Name\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Structure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"am/are/is +  being + past participle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Healing with music <span class=\\\"strong\\\">is being implemented</span> in a more personal manner.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Perfect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have/has + been + past participle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">It <span class=\\\"strong\\\">has been said</span> that music has a healing effect.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "On a large scale, this has been demonstrated by renowned musicians such as Luciano Pavarotti, David Bowie, and Bono. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "It must be catching on, because centers have been constructed around the world, and music therapy programs are constantly being added to university course lists. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "More patients are being referred to music therapists by physicians, psychologists, and occupational therapists."}, {"type": "example", "content": "This exciting new career path is being chosen by increasing numbers of music lovers who wish to share their passion with those who need it most.   "}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "type": "WLC", "questions": [], "img_path": "", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outc