{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn9le15ob03re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le15ob03re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn9le15ob03re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn9le15ob03re2img01.jpg", "text": "It has been said that music has a healing effect. On a large scale, this has been demonstrated by renowned musicians such as Luciano Pavarotti, David Bowie, and Bono. They came together in the 90s to perform several concerts for War Child, a non-governmental organization (NGO). Although the main focus of these humanitarian efforts was to raise money for those in need, they also set an example for how music can be used to relieve pain, and some feel as though it can even promote happiness in those who suffer.", "id": 1}, {"time": "31500", "image": "engenn9le15ob03re2img03.jpg", "text": "Nowadays, healing with music is being implemented in a more personal manner, through the use of music therapy. It must be catching on, because centers have been constructed around the world, and music therapy programs are constantly being added to university course lists. Music therapists work alongside pediatricians and other health professionals to ease pain and encourage recovery in patients. They focus on using musical expression to improve motor skills, social skills and even cognitive functioning.", "id": 2}, {"time": "63000", "image": "engenn9le15ob03re2img02.jpg", "text": "The field of music therapy has been growing steadily since the 90s. In the past, some health professionals were skeptical, but presently it seems more and more patients are being referred to music therapists by physicians, psychologists, and occupational therapists. This exciting new career path is being chosen by increasing numbers of music lovers who wish to share their passion with those who need it most.", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}